#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/selection_masks.rst:1
msgid "How to use selection masks in Krita."
msgstr "Kako uporabljati maske izbora v Krita."

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/selection_masks.rst:15
msgid "Layers"
msgstr "Plasti"

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/selection_masks.rst:15
msgid "Masks"
msgstr "Maske"

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/selection_masks.rst:15
msgid "Selections"
msgstr "Izbori"

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/selection_masks.rst:20
msgid "Selection Masks"
msgstr "Maske izbora"

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/selection_masks.rst:22
msgid ""
"Local Selection masks let you remember and recall edit a selection on a "
"layer. They work in a similar way to extra channels in other image editing "
"programs. One difference is :program:`Krita's` ability to assign them to "
"specific layers and activate a selection with a single click on the layer. "
"Just click the round icon with the dotted outline on the local selection "
"layer in the Layers docker."
msgstr ""
"Maske krajevnega izbora vam omogočajo, da si zapomnite in prikličete "
"urejanje izbora na plasti. Delujejo podobno kot dodatni kanali v drugih "
"programih za urejanje slik. Ena razlika je :program:`Kritina` sposobnost, da "
"jih dodeli določenim plastem in aktivira izbor z enim klikom plasti. Samo "
"kliknite okroglo ikono s pikastim orisom na krajevni plasti izbora v "
"zloženem oknu Plasti."

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/selection_masks.rst:24
msgid ""
"To create a Local Selection Mask, you must first create a selection, then |"
"mouseright| on the desired layer and select :menuselection:`Local Selection`."
msgstr ""
"Če želite ustvariti masko krajevnega izbora, morate najprej ustvariti izbor, "
"nato pa |mouseright| želeno plast ter izbrati :menuselection:`Krajevni "
"izbor`."

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/selection_masks.rst:26
msgid ""
"When isolating a selection mask with the :kbd:`Alt +` |mouseleft| shortcut, "
"you can perform transformation, deformation and paint operations on the "
"selection layer, modifying the selection."
msgstr ""
"Ko izberete masko z bližnjico :kbd:`izmenjalka +` |mouseleft|, lahko "
"izvedete preoblikovanje, deformacijo in operacije barvanja na plasti izbora, "
"s čimer spreminjate izbor."

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/selection_masks.rst:28
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A single layer can contain multiple Local Selection Masks. Repeating. A "
"single layer can contain multiple Local Selection Masks (LSM). This is "
"important because it means that you can, for instance, have several "
"different outline parts of an image and save each as its own LSM and then "
"recall it with a single click. Without using LSM you would have to create "
"layer upon layer for each mask. Not only would this be inefficient for you "
"but also for Krita and the program would slow down trying to keep up with it "
"all. LSM's are one of the most important features in Krita!"
msgstr ""
"Ena plast lahko vsebuje več mask krajevnega izbora. Ponavljajoče se. Ena "
"plast lahko vsebuje več krajevnih mask izbora (LSM). To je pomembno, ker "
"pomeni, da lahko imate npr. več različnih orisnih delov slike in shranite "
"vsak kot svoj LSM in ga nato opomnite z enim klikom. Brez uporabe LSM bi "
"morali ustvariti plast na plasti za vsako masko. Ne samo, da bi bilo to "
"neučinkovito, ampak tudi za Krito in program bi upočasnil, ko bi poskušal "
"držati stik z vsem. LSM so ena najpomembnejših funkcionalnosti v Kriti!"

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/selection_masks.rst:30
msgid ""
"The example below shows three LSM items all attached (under) Layer1. Any of "
"these can be activated and used at any time."
msgstr ""
"Spodnji primer prikazuje vse tri elemente LSM priložene (pod) Plast1. "
"Poljubnega izmed njih lahko kadarkoli aktivirate in uporabljate."

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/selection_masks.rst:33
msgid ".. image:: images/selection/local-selection-mask.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/selection/local-selection-mask.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/selection_masks.rst:35
#, fuzzy
msgid "Global Selection"
msgstr "Globalni izbor"

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/selection_masks.rst:37
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You can modify the global selection the same way you can with a local-"
"selection. To do so, you first need to activate the global selection as a "
"layer node. To do so, go into :menuselection:`Select --> Show Global "
"Selection Mask`. The global selection, if you have anything selected, will "
"now appear on the top of the layer stack as a selection mask."
msgstr ""
"Globalni izbor lahko spremenite na enak način, kot lahko spremenite krajevni "
"izbor. Če želite to storiti, morate najprej aktivirati globalni izbor kot "
"vozlišče plasti. Če želite to storiti, izberite :menuselection:`Izberi --> "
"Prikaži globalno masko izbora`. Globalni izbor, če ste kaj izbrali, se bo "
"zdaj pojavil na vrhu plasti kot maska izbora."
